1
00:01:03,799 --> 00:01:06,799
Bed pushed back against the bedroom wall,

2
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,400
I won't let my frozen stiffness make me fall!

3
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:14,200
The Latin rhythm scrapes and starts to pound,

4
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,799
My bare feet gripping on the vinyl ground.

5
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,799
Sweat in my eyes, I'm breaking the frame!

6
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:25,500
No more counting numbers, no more playing it tame!

7
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:29,299
One-two, cha-cha-cha, I'm going insane!

8
00:01:29,500 --> 00:01:33,200
Tearing through the muscle and the physical pain!

9
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:05,200
I force my knees to bend, my hips to sway,

10
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:08,800
Fighting the cold machine that stands in my way!

11
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:12,400
My T-shirt is soaked, sticking tight to my skin,

12
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:16,000
I rip it off and throw it in the corner bin!

13
00:02:16,300 --> 00:02:20,099
Sweat on the floor, I'm breaking the frame!

14
00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:23,800
No more counting numbers, no more playing it tame!

15
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:27,400
One-two, cha-cha-cha, I'm going insane!

16
00:02:27,599 --> 00:02:31,199
Tearing through the muscle and the physical pain!

17
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:49,000
Bare chest dripping in the dim desk light,

18
00:02:49,199 --> 00:02:53,000
Dancing with a ghost in the middle of the night!

19
00:02:53,199 --> 00:02:56,800
No wooden steps like that guy in the crowd

20
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:00,599
I want the living fire, loud, fierce and proud!

21
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:04,199
I tear through the air, my heels strike the floor,

22
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:07,699
I don't want to be a silent ghost anymore!

23
00:03:07,900 --> 00:03:11,400
Faster and wilder, the rhythm takes control,

24
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:15,300
Ripping out the coldness from my searching soul!

25
00:03:58,199 --> 00:04:03,500
One-two, cha-cha-cha... my lungs burn hot...

26
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:10,500
I collapse onto the floor.

27
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:18,000
Silence fills the room once more.

28
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:25,500
Everything finally stops.